<title>FRANCE: Alcatel signs Russian satellite deal.</title>
<headline>Alcatel signs Russian satellite deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Alcatel Alsthom said on Tuesday it had singed a contract to supply three communication payloads for Express-A satellites to Siberia-based industrial group NPO-PM.</p>
<p>Alcatel said in a statement the supply deal was signed with the Russian Space Agency, Russian satellite operator RSCC and NPO-PM.</p>
<p>Financial details were not revealed.</p>
</text>
